<title>USA: NCH Corp Q4 April 30 net declines.</title>
<headline>NCH Corp Q4 April 30 net declines.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.14		    $1.31</p>
<p> Net			  8,229		   10,247</p>
<p> Revs		     188,349		  190,578</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,172		    7,811</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $4.73		    $4.51</p>
<p> Net			 34,675		   36,307</p>
<p> Revs		     766,761		  772,834</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,326		    8,052</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1997 operating income was $14 million vs $16.2 million for Q4 1996. Full-year 1997 operating income was $56.3 million vs $61 million for 1996.</p>
<p>Full-year 1997 results include after-tax gain of $2.3 million from selling a business unit.</p>
